@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il27-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il27-tax-years`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Income Tax Ordinance s 40A — "נקודת זיכוי לגרוש שנשא אשה אחרת". Row IL-27. Source lines 1648-1649.
--
-- One credit point for a divorcee who, or whose spouse, pays maintenance to his former spouse, and who is married to another spouse.
--
-- Facts the caller states: that he is a divorcee, that he or his spouse paid maintenance to the former spouse (read as in the tax year,
-- the year of the computation), and that he is married to a spouse other than the former one.
-- Fork F3: "גרוש" is the masculine form and the heading says "another woman", but the body says "בן־זוג" of both. Whether a woman who
-- is divorced is within the section: one named switch (RULED by Meng on 2026-10-08, SHRUG), default declined where the individual is
-- a woman who would otherwise have the point; "a divorced man only" and "either sex" kept by name and tested.
-- Fork F1 (residence) applies: the section names none.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Section 40A — a divorcee who has married again`

-- src:1649 | בחישוב המס של גרוש שהוא או בן־זוגו משלם מזונות לבן זוגו לשעבר, והוא נשוי לבן־זוג אחר, תובא בחשבון נקודת זיכוי אחת.

@ref ITO s 40A, line 1649
GIVEN i IS A `A divorced individual in a tax year, for section 40A`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 40A — the point on the facts, before any reading of "divorcee", for` i MEANS
    IF   i's `a divorcee`
         AND i's `he or his spouse paid maintenance to his former spouse in the tax year`
         AND i's `married to a spouse other than the former spouse`
    THEN 1
    ELSE 0

@ref ITO s 40A, line 1649; fork F3
GIVETH A `A reading of "divorcee" in section 40A`
`section 40A — the reading row IL-27 takes of "divorcee"` MEANS
    `declined where the individual is a woman`

@ref ITO s 40A, line 1648 (heading) and line 1649; fork F3
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 40A does not say whether a divorcee who is a woman is within it, and here the individual is a woman` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 40A does not say whether a divorcee who is a woman is within it, and here the individual is a woman"

@ref ITO s 40A, lines 1648-1649; forks F1, F3
GIVEN rd IS A `A reading of "divorcee" in section 40A`
      rr IS A `A reading of the sections that name no residence condition (ss 39A, 39B, 40A, 40B)`
      i  IS A `A divorced individual in a tax year, for section 40A`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the credit points under section 40A, reading "divorcee" as` rd `and the residence condition as` rr `, for` i MEANS
    `for tax year` (i's `tax year`) `, row IL-27 answers`
        (`the points, unless section 48A may take them from a foreign worker:` (i's `a foreign worker`) `,`
            (`points under a section that names no residence condition, for` (i's `an Israeli resident in the tax year`) `, the points being` `the points` `, reading the condition as` rr))
    WHERE
        `on the facts` MEANS `s 40A — the point on the facts, before any reading of "divorcee", for` i
        `the points` MEANS
            CONSIDER i's `sex`
            WHEN `a man` THEN `on the facts`
            WHEN `a woman` THEN
                CONSIDER rd
                WHEN `a divorced man only`                           THEN 0
                WHEN `a divorced person of either sex`               THEN `on the facts`
                WHEN `declined where the individual is a woman`
                    THEN IF   `on the facts` EQUALS 0
                         THEN 0
                         ELSE `section 40A does not say whether a divorcee who is a woman is within it, and here the individual is a woman`

@export The credit points under Income Tax Ordinance s 40A (a divorcee who has married again and who, or whose spouse, pays maintenance to the former spouse) for a tax year from 2024: one point; declines for a woman, for one who is not an Israeli resident, and for a foreign worker (s 48A)
@ref ITO s 40A, lines 1648-1649
GIVEN i IS A `A divorced individual in a tax year, for section 40A`
          @desc the tax year, residence, sex, whether he is a divorcee, whether he or his spouse paid maintenance to his former spouse in the tax year, and whether he is married to a spouse other than the former spouse
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the credit points under section 40A for` i MEANS
    `the credit points under section 40A, reading "divorcee" as` `section 40A — the reading row IL-27 takes of "divorcee"` `and the residence condition as` `the reading row IL-27 takes of the sections that name no residence condition` `, for` i
